        rdfs:label "Equus scotti follicular Turing wavelength at 164 µm (Irvingtonian, 0.6 Ma) — Source and data traceability: 88/100" ;
        dct:date "2026-10-27"^^xsd:date ;
        dct:description "DOIs for Turing, Schnakenberg, Bard 1977 and 1981, Murray, and MacFadden are in the bib and the reference JSON. The Horsfall JPEG is SHA-256 pinned and traced to Wikimedia Commons under public domain. The README states 164 µm and 0.6 Ma. The scout manifest records that slot 3220 is outside campaign_100_slots.yaml and was queried on OpenAlex, Crossref, and Wikimedia directly." ;
        dct:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-source-traceability> ;
        pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/model/grok-4.7> ;
